WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:18.490
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:18.760 --> 01:22.520
As discussed in our last meeting, for the Foresta Collection concept,

3
01:22.600 --> 01:25.320
which focuses on the linework of flowers and leaves,

4
01:25.400 --> 01:27.960
I'd like to present the designs for your consideration.

5
01:30.480 --> 01:33.920
These are the ninth set of initial sketches.

6
01:34.000 --> 01:36.160
This piece is a necklace,

7
01:36.240 --> 01:37.880
featuring a square-link chain.

8
01:37.960 --> 01:40.440
There are also earrings and a ring.

9
01:51.600 --> 01:54.960
The overall collection will look something like this.

10
01:55.400 --> 01:59.080
If you'd like to make changes or any adjustments,

11
01:59.160 --> 02:00.320
please let me know.

12
02:13.320 --> 02:15.600
I'd like to do a few more styles.

13
02:23.000 --> 02:25.120
Women have different tastes and styles.

14
02:25.200 --> 02:26.680
Some are sweet,

15
02:26.760 --> 02:28.120
some are cool,

16
02:28.200 --> 02:29.360
some are refined.

17
02:30.120 --> 02:32.320
Everyone has their own preferences.

18
02:41.600 --> 02:42.760
What is it, Cream?

19
02:43.280 --> 02:45.440
Then please come up with some additional designs,

20
02:45.520 --> 02:47.800
and let's schedule a wrap-up meeting for next week.

21
02:48.280 --> 02:49.520
Certainly, Chairwoman.

22
02:56.720 --> 02:57.880
What is it?

23
02:57.960 --> 02:59.520
Mr. Sam has caused trouble again.

24
03:00.160 --> 03:01.120
Again?

25
03:02.080 --> 03:03.720
Yes, again.

26
03:06.000 --> 03:08.240
When will she ever learn?

27
03:10.040 --> 03:11.640
Is this nurse quitting too?

28
03:12.320 --> 03:13.240
Yes.

29
03:14.000 --> 03:15.560
Ms. Nueng tried to talk her into staying,

30
03:15.640 --> 03:16.920
but it didn't work.

31
03:18.720 --> 03:19.880
Same as always.

32
03:23.000 --> 03:24.480
Sometimes I wonder

33
03:24.560 --> 03:26.400
why I have to clean up their mess.

34
03:30.200 --> 03:31.800
Find a new nurse as soon as possible.

35
03:32.680 --> 03:33.600
Yes,

36
03:34.240 --> 03:36.120
but it may take some time.

37
03:36.840 --> 03:39.960
It took us a while to find the last one.

38
03:40.680 --> 03:42.040
I don't care.

39
03:42.120 --> 03:43.640
Make it happen faster.

40
03:44.120 --> 03:46.760
My mother needs someone looking after her 24/7.

41
03:47.520 --> 03:48.800
I don't care what it costs.

42
03:49.560 --> 03:50.400
Yes.

43
03:50.480 --> 03:52.880
Just find a temporary nurse in the meantime.

44
03:52.960 --> 03:55.480
Ask Nueng and Cream to help out too.

45
03:56.079 --> 03:57.120
That's all.

46
03:57.200 --> 03:58.440
Yes, Ms. Song.

47
04:20.000 --> 04:22.640
Look, it's Dr. Smith!

48
04:23.320 --> 04:25.440
So handsome, with that face card!

49
04:25.520 --> 04:27.440
What's card?

50
04:27.520 --> 04:28.920
It means he's super handsome.

51
04:29.920 --> 04:31.920
Hello, Doctor.

52
04:32.000 --> 04:33.080
Hello.

53
04:40.360 --> 04:41.760
What's up, little brother?

54
04:41.840 --> 04:42.840
Hi.

55
04:43.560 --> 04:44.880
You see…

56
04:45.680 --> 04:47.800
Ms. Song's private nurse has quit. Again.

57
04:48.760 --> 04:50.040
How many is that now?

58
04:51.600 --> 04:52.520
Seven.

59
04:52.600 --> 04:55.080
So Mr. Sam is every nurse's worst nightmare.

60
04:56.360 --> 04:59.040
Are you just calling to get me to buy you lunch?

61
04:59.120 --> 05:00.320
It's not that.

62
05:01.120 --> 05:02.680
I need your help.

63
05:03.680 --> 05:05.680
Can you help me find a nurse?

64
05:06.200 --> 05:07.320
Nah.

65
05:07.960 --> 05:10.960
If I send someone over and Mr. Sam gives them trouble again,

66
05:11.040 --> 05:12.280
it'll ruin my reputation.

67
05:12.960 --> 05:14.840
That's why I've never asked you before.

68
05:15.320 --> 05:17.040
But this time I'm at a dead end.

69
05:18.080 --> 05:20.320
I don't want Ms. Song getting stressed out over this again.

70
05:22.520 --> 05:24.000
You're really worried about her.

71
05:24.080 --> 05:25.880
Have you even made any progress with her?

72
05:25.960 --> 05:27.880
Smith, I'm serious.

73
05:29.560 --> 05:31.040
Yeah, I know.

74
05:31.440 --> 05:32.560
I'll see what I can do.

75
05:33.040 --> 05:34.440
But no promises, okay?

76
05:34.520 --> 05:35.960
That's already a big help.

77
05:51.560 --> 05:52.960
There you go.

78
05:54.159 --> 05:56.320
Once you're done here,

79
05:56.400 --> 05:58.600
head up to Finance on the fourth floor.

80
05:58.680 --> 06:01.280
We'll see you at your next appointment, okay?

81
06:04.760 --> 06:05.960
Excuse me.

82
06:13.960 --> 06:16.600
I appreciate the thought, but you really don't need to do that.

83
06:16.680 --> 06:17.680
Thank you.

84
06:22.240 --> 06:24.200
I need to do something about this.

85
06:25.040 --> 06:26.040
What was that?

86
06:26.120 --> 06:27.240
Oh, nothing.

87
06:30.280 --> 06:31.640
I think I know someone.

88
06:32.840 --> 06:33.920
What about the salary?

89
06:34.280 --> 06:35.360
Name your price.

90
06:36.040 --> 06:37.880
Ms. Song will meet their demands.

91
06:38.360 --> 06:39.360
Okay.

92
06:40.680 --> 06:42.320
I'll call you if I find someone.

93
06:42.400 --> 06:43.480
Thank you.

94
06:43.560 --> 06:44.680
That's all for now.

95
06:52.120 --> 06:54.680
Professor, could you sign this medical certificate?

96
06:55.880 --> 06:57.000
Sure.

97
07:01.320 --> 07:03.360
-Here you go. -This one too, Professor.

98
07:04.160 --> 07:05.240
Of course.

99
07:10.240 --> 07:11.560
-There you go. -Thank you.

100
07:13.600 --> 07:14.720
Ms. Uttawadee.

101
07:15.080 --> 07:16.320
Yes, Professor?

102
07:16.680 --> 07:18.640
Could you come to my office later?

103
07:18.720 --> 07:19.840
Right now?

104
07:20.520 --> 07:21.520
Not yet.

105
07:21.600 --> 07:23.520
I have to make rounds in Room 1608 first.

106
07:23.600 --> 07:24.920
Okay.

107
07:25.600 --> 07:26.600
Thanks.

108
07:53.280 --> 07:54.920
Oops, my hand slipped.

109
08:08.120 --> 08:10.400
Oops, my hand slipped.

110
08:10.480 --> 08:12.640
-Hey! I haven't even touched that yet! -Yeah.

111
08:13.560 --> 08:15.120
Maybe it's contagious.

112
08:44.640 --> 08:46.160
How's your mother doing, Oh?

113
08:49.840 --> 08:50.960
Well,

114
08:51.320 --> 08:53.480
ever since they found the new cancer cells,

115
08:53.560 --> 08:56.800
she's been taking it pretty hard, as you know.

116
08:59.800 --> 09:01.320
Don't lose heart.

117
09:02.360 --> 09:05.000
She beat it last time.

118
09:05.720 --> 09:07.560
She'll get through this too.

119
09:08.880 --> 09:10.240
I hope so.

120
09:11.760 --> 09:13.600
Let me know if you need anything.

121
09:13.680 --> 09:14.720
Maybe I can help.

122
09:15.800 --> 09:17.040
Thank you.

123
09:19.800 --> 09:23.320
You'll need lots of money for her treatment, right?

124
09:25.800 --> 09:26.760
Yes.

125
09:27.280 --> 09:30.720
My sister and I are trying to earn more

126
09:30.800 --> 09:33.080
to cover the medical expenses.

127
09:33.160 --> 09:34.080
Hmm.

128
09:38.720 --> 09:41.760
If you had a chance to earn several times more than you do now,

129
09:41.840 --> 09:44.360
would you be willing to leave this job for it?

130
09:45.680 --> 09:46.840
What kind of job?

131
09:47.880 --> 09:50.600
Private nursing for an elderly woman at home.

132
09:51.520 --> 09:53.440
She's someone I really respect.

133
09:54.680 --> 09:56.720
You'd have one day off a week.

134
09:57.320 --> 10:00.120
The pay is almost five times what you're making now.

135
10:02.920 --> 10:04.280
May I ask about her condition?

136
10:05.200 --> 10:06.760
She has paraplegia

137
10:07.680 --> 10:09.160
and stage-two Alzheimer's.

138
10:09.760 --> 10:12.800
She needs around-the-clock support.

139
10:14.080 --> 10:15.360
Is her condition serious?

140
10:16.080 --> 10:17.080
Not that bad.

141
10:17.760 --> 10:20.640
Her daughter just wants someone there to keep her safe.

142
10:21.480 --> 10:22.560
I see.

143
10:23.400 --> 10:25.520
When would I start?

144
10:26.320 --> 10:28.760
Honestly, they need someone to start right away.

145
10:29.400 --> 10:32.120
It's a good opportunity, so I thought I'd let you know.

146
10:33.440 --> 10:34.480
Okay.

147
10:43.040 --> 10:44.160
As for your mother,

148
10:45.120 --> 10:47.000
I'll check on her regularly.

149
10:47.440 --> 10:48.440
Don't worry.

150
10:49.080 --> 10:50.400
Thank you.

151
10:51.520 --> 10:54.840
I'll give you my answer as soon as I can.

152
10:55.400 --> 10:56.240
Sure.

153
10:57.160 --> 10:58.920
Then I'll get going.

154
10:59.560 --> 11:00.640
Of course.

155
11:12.160 --> 11:14.640
Let's see if those guys still try to hit on her.

156
11:16.320 --> 11:17.560
Did you find someone?

157
11:17.640 --> 11:18.360
Yes.

158
11:19.120 --> 11:21.120
She'll discuss it with her family first,

159
11:21.200 --> 11:22.720
but I don't think there'll be a problem.

160
11:23.960 --> 11:25.120
As for the salary,

161
11:26.480 --> 11:28.480
offer her 10% more than the last nurse.

162
11:28.800 --> 11:29.840
No problem.

163
11:29.920 --> 11:31.320
I'll tell Ms. Song right away.

164
11:33.520 --> 11:35.800
So eager to win her favor… or maybe her heart?

165
11:36.640 --> 11:37.760
Smith.

166
11:39.440 --> 11:40.800
Yeah, yeah. I know.

167
11:42.120 --> 11:43.960
Come on, everyone! This is the last piece!

168
11:44.040 --> 11:46.600
I'm ending the livestream in five minutes.

169
11:46.680 --> 11:48.480
You won't find this price anywhere else!

170
11:48.560 --> 11:50.320
It's a special deal.

171
11:50.400 --> 11:53.120
Everyone needs this color. Don't miss it.

172
11:53.200 --> 11:54.920
It's so pretty!

173
11:55.000 --> 11:56.440
It looks even better in person!

174
11:56.520 --> 11:58.320
Add it to your basket now!

175
11:58.640 --> 12:02.840
You'll also get a coupon for 50% off!

176
12:02.920 --> 12:03.840
See?

177
12:03.920 --> 12:07.000
You're getting such a great deal with my livestream.

178
12:07.320 --> 12:09.160
And up next, we have something

179
12:09.240 --> 12:10.920
you've all been waiting for.

180
12:11.000 --> 12:13.320
The camisole set!

181
12:14.040 --> 12:15.920
This camisole set

182
12:16.000 --> 12:18.320
comes in a classy purple pattern.

183
12:18.400 --> 12:21.720
It'll give you a sweet and chic vibe.

184
12:21.800 --> 12:23.640
It looks amazing on camera!

185
12:23.720 --> 12:25.880
I've got it in various colors and sizes.

186
12:25.960 --> 12:28.520
You can order this set even outside the livestream!

187
12:28.600 --> 12:30.800
That's it for today, everyone!

188
12:30.880 --> 12:33.840
See you next time! Bye!

189
12:41.680 --> 12:42.760
Finally.

190
12:45.560 --> 12:47.720
Here. Have some water first.

191
12:47.800 --> 12:49.000
-Thanks. -Tired?

192
12:49.080 --> 12:51.960
No, but I didn't sell much today.

193
12:52.040 --> 12:53.880
I wonder where everyone went.

194
12:53.960 --> 12:55.960
At least I'll still get my livestream hours.

195
12:56.920 --> 12:58.080
-Right. -Hmm?

196
12:59.720 --> 13:01.240
Let me show you something.

197
13:07.160 --> 13:08.240
Hold on.

198
13:13.920 --> 13:15.480
Wow, that's a lot!

199
13:15.560 --> 13:16.720
Right?

200
13:16.800 --> 13:20.160
I'll use this money for Mom's next treatment

201
13:20.680 --> 13:21.960
and groceries.

202
13:23.480 --> 13:24.640
Hmm.

203
13:24.720 --> 13:26.880
Nothing for yourself?

204
13:28.360 --> 13:29.520
Mm.

205
13:30.840 --> 13:32.440
Nope. I don't need anything.

206
13:32.920 --> 13:34.520
I have plenty of sponsored clothes.

207
13:34.840 --> 13:36.120
You want some?

208
13:36.880 --> 13:38.040
You keep them.

209
13:38.120 --> 13:39.520
I don't go anywhere anyway.

210
13:39.600 --> 13:42.520
Just work and home.

211
13:43.480 --> 13:44.560
True.

212
13:48.240 --> 13:50.200
I still have to pack everything up.

213
13:50.280 --> 13:51.440
Your shoulders sore?

214
13:51.520 --> 13:52.600
A little.

215
13:53.400 --> 13:54.400
Really?

216
13:55.880 --> 13:57.120
Thanks!

217
13:59.240 --> 14:02.240
By the way, do you have any tutoring today?

218
14:02.800 --> 14:03.960
Not anymore.

219
14:05.760 --> 14:06.920
Hmm…

220
14:08.560 --> 14:09.640
-Ong? -Yeah?

221
14:09.720 --> 14:11.440
Can we talk?

222
14:13.240 --> 14:16.480
Professor Smith just offered me a job.

223
14:17.640 --> 14:19.320
A job? What kind?

224
14:20.200 --> 14:21.640
Private nursing.

225
14:21.720 --> 14:24.680
I'd have to live at the patient's home.

226
14:24.760 --> 14:25.800
Wait.

227
14:25.880 --> 14:27.480
Is the patient a man or a woman?

228
14:27.840 --> 14:28.920
A woman.

229
14:31.400 --> 14:34.200
I'd get Sundays off.

230
14:35.040 --> 14:36.960
Whoa, that's a demanding job.

231
14:38.040 --> 14:39.520
How much does it pay?

232
14:49.640 --> 14:52.240
With that kind of money, take it!

233
14:52.320 --> 14:54.080
I'll even help you pack.

234
14:54.160 --> 14:55.760
Take everything you need!

235
14:55.840 --> 14:56.960
No hesitation at all, huh?

236
14:57.040 --> 14:58.720
Go! Shoo, shoo!

237
14:58.800 --> 15:00.320
I'll pack everything for you right now.

238
15:00.400 --> 15:01.520
How's that?

239
15:02.040 --> 15:03.200
Hmm…

240
15:04.680 --> 15:05.800
What about Mom?

241
15:06.680 --> 15:08.200
Can you take care of her?

242
15:08.280 --> 15:09.840
And what about your studies?

243
15:10.960 --> 15:12.080
Don't worry.

244
15:12.160 --> 15:14.840
I only have my thesis left, and then I'll graduate.

245
15:14.920 --> 15:17.120
Just go. I'll take care of Mom.

246
15:17.640 --> 15:19.120
If we're earning this much every month,

247
15:19.200 --> 15:21.720
you won't have to tire yourself with tutoring anymore.

248
15:22.960 --> 15:25.720
But what about your job at the hospital?

249
15:26.680 --> 15:27.960
I'm only working part-time.

250
15:28.040 --> 15:29.560
It shouldn't be a problem.

251
15:30.160 --> 15:31.640
Professor Smith

252
15:31.720 --> 15:34.360
already promised to help check on Mom too.

253
15:36.280 --> 15:38.760
Oh, but doesn't he

254
15:39.480 --> 15:41.720
already come here regularly?

255
15:44.800 --> 15:46.800
I just wanted you to know.

256
15:48.080 --> 15:49.160
Hmm.

257
15:49.240 --> 15:51.320
When will you give him your answer?

258
15:51.400 --> 15:52.880
I wanted to discuss it with you first.

259
15:52.960 --> 15:54.360
Then I'll talk to Mom.

260
15:55.240 --> 15:57.600
I can give him my answer tomorrow.

261
15:58.880 --> 16:01.240
Okay. Let's go see Mom, then.

262
16:05.640 --> 16:07.600
Just take the job if you want to.

263
16:07.680 --> 16:09.920
I'll be just fine with Ong.

264
16:10.520 --> 16:11.880
You won't get lonely, will you?

265
16:12.600 --> 16:14.480
I'll miss you, of course.

266
16:14.560 --> 16:15.880
But I don't want you

267
16:15.960 --> 16:18.040
to turn down a good opportunity because of me.

268
16:18.760 --> 16:20.760
If your dad were still here,

269
16:21.200 --> 16:23.000
he'd be so proud of you.

270
16:24.520 --> 16:25.720
What about me?

271
16:33.000 --> 16:34.400
What about me, huh?

272
16:35.080 --> 16:36.360
I'm proud of you too.

273
16:36.440 --> 16:38.040
I have such wonderful daughters.

274
16:42.360 --> 16:43.960
Now go take a shower

275
16:44.040 --> 16:45.320
and get some rest.

276
16:45.400 --> 16:46.360
-Yes. -Okay.

277
16:46.440 --> 16:47.880
I'm going to get some rest too.

278
16:50.120 --> 16:51.480
Let me take that for you.

279
17:18.359 --> 17:19.920
Ong, you can shower first.

280
17:20.000 --> 17:21.319
Let me know when you're done.

281
17:21.400 --> 17:22.440
Okay.

282
17:50.600 --> 17:51.560
Someday,

283
17:52.280 --> 17:54.040
things will get better for us.

284
18:04.800 --> 18:06.400
I'll take the job.

285
18:07.320 --> 18:08.400
Wonderful!

286
18:09.240 --> 18:11.120
They've sent over a contract.

287
18:11.600 --> 18:12.640
Take a look.

288
18:22.680 --> 18:24.000
But first,

289
18:24.440 --> 18:27.040
there are a few things I need to tell you.

290
18:28.480 --> 18:29.640
What things?

291
18:32.880 --> 18:34.440
The son of the family

292
18:35.280 --> 18:36.480
is quite a womanizer.

293
18:36.960 --> 18:39.360
He tends to give the nurses a hard time,

294
18:40.200 --> 18:42.520
which is why so many of them quit.

295
18:46.680 --> 18:48.240
But don't worry.

296
18:48.920 --> 18:50.520
You'll be perfectly safe.

297
18:51.360 --> 18:53.160
I've told everyone there

298
18:54.240 --> 18:55.520
that you're my girlfriend,

299
18:56.960 --> 18:59.160
so they'll make sure you're well looked after.

300
18:59.240 --> 19:01.080
You told them we're dating?

301
19:01.680 --> 19:02.800
Is it really okay?

302
19:03.320 --> 19:04.800
What about your reputation?

303
19:06.960 --> 19:08.280
Not at all.

304
19:08.360 --> 19:09.760
I'm happy to help.

305
19:15.320 --> 19:16.920
I'd love for this to become real too.

306
19:17.840 --> 19:19.040
What was that?

307
19:21.080 --> 19:23.800
I said it's for the best.

308
19:24.840 --> 19:27.160
Anyway, apart from the playboy son,

309
19:27.240 --> 19:29.560
everyone there is perfectly nice.

310
19:31.080 --> 19:34.360
You can focus on your work and save money for your mother's treatment.

311
19:40.440 --> 19:41.520
Okay.

312
19:41.600 --> 19:43.280
If you say so,

313
19:43.360 --> 19:44.640
I'll take it.

314
19:45.760 --> 19:47.880
All right. Read through the contract first.

315
19:47.960 --> 19:49.600
Everything will be as discussed.

316
19:50.960 --> 19:53.240
But the employer's details aren't included.

317
19:54.800 --> 19:56.360
If you'd prefer,

318
19:56.440 --> 19:58.840
you can sign it tomorrow when you arrive.

319
20:00.000 --> 20:01.280
That's fine.

320
20:01.360 --> 20:03.560
Today or tomorrow makes no difference.

321
20:03.640 --> 20:04.840
I trust you, Professor.

322
20:08.200 --> 20:09.360
Thank you.

323
20:12.800 --> 20:14.480
One more thing.

324
20:15.160 --> 20:17.640
To keep up our fake relationship,

325
20:17.720 --> 20:20.240
you'll have to start calling me Smith

326
20:21.080 --> 20:22.280
instead of Professor.

327
20:25.000 --> 20:26.000
I see.

328
20:27.320 --> 20:28.320
Okay…

329
20:29.080 --> 20:30.080
Smith.

330
20:32.360 --> 20:33.400
Good.

331
20:41.160 --> 20:42.680
I thought you were joking!

332
20:43.480 --> 20:45.000
So you're really taking it?

333
20:46.040 --> 20:47.000
Yeah.

334
20:47.640 --> 20:49.400
Why, Oh? Why?

335
20:49.480 --> 20:51.200
It's so sudden!

336
20:51.680 --> 20:53.400
What am I supposed to do without you?

337
20:53.840 --> 20:56.320
Who am I going to have lunch with?

338
20:59.880 --> 21:02.200
It's not like we see each other every day.

339
21:02.680 --> 21:04.320
We hardly ever work the same shifts.

340
21:06.880 --> 21:08.680
But we still get to see each other, okay?

341
21:09.600 --> 21:11.000
I'm sad, you know.

342
21:11.080 --> 21:12.120
Okay, okay.

343
21:12.200 --> 21:13.880
I'll come by on my days off.

344
21:13.960 --> 21:15.480
We can grab a meal together.

345
21:17.840 --> 21:18.640
Listen,

346
21:19.240 --> 21:20.880
you have to stay in touch.

347
21:21.520 --> 21:23.800
Don't disappear on me, okay?

348
21:24.320 --> 21:27.000
Sure. I'll call and keep you updated.

349
21:27.080 --> 21:28.120
Good?

350
21:30.160 --> 21:31.200
Fine.

351
21:44.000 --> 21:44.920
What?!

352
21:45.720 --> 21:48.320
They require 120 days' notice before resigning?

353
21:50.120 --> 21:51.640
That's outrageous!

354
21:51.720 --> 21:53.640
It's usually only 30 days.

355
21:54.880 --> 21:57.240
And the penalty is five times your salary?

356
21:58.920 --> 22:00.480
That's brutal.

357
22:01.560 --> 22:02.800
I'll be fine.

358
22:02.880 --> 22:05.400
I usually stay at my jobs for a long time anyway.

359
22:07.720 --> 22:10.440
Yeah, Superwoman.

360
22:10.880 --> 22:12.680
You're good at everything.

361
22:33.600 --> 22:36.680
SIGNATURE MISS UTTAWADEE SENTANUN

362
22:39.640 --> 22:40.880
Here are the documents.

363
22:50.200 --> 22:52.680
The new nurse will arrive at Mrs. Pinthong's house

364
22:52.760 --> 22:54.080
around 1 p.m. tomorrow.

365
22:54.640 --> 22:56.440
Smith will take her there.

366
22:58.480 --> 23:00.480
Is she close to Smith?

367
23:00.560 --> 23:03.080
He recommended her and is even taking her there himself.

368
23:03.680 --> 23:04.760
Well…

369
23:05.520 --> 23:06.640
You see…

370
23:06.720 --> 23:08.720
She's his girlfriend.

371
23:10.320 --> 23:12.360
Have I not mentioned that?

372
23:14.040 --> 23:15.160
I'm sorry.

373
23:15.240 --> 23:16.760
I thought I'd told you everything.

374
23:18.320 --> 23:19.720
Maybe I just forgot.

375
23:24.520 --> 23:27.200
Having Smith's girlfriend work there should be fine too.

376
23:27.280 --> 23:29.000
It solves the problem with Sam.

377
23:30.000 --> 23:32.280
He wouldn't dare mess with his girlfriend.

378
23:33.880 --> 23:35.040
Right.

379
23:35.440 --> 23:37.560
Do I have any appointments around that time?

380
23:38.200 --> 23:41.240
Just an internal meeting with the design and marketing teams.

381
23:41.840 --> 23:42.880
Reschedule it.

382
23:42.960 --> 23:44.280
I want to meet Smith

383
23:44.360 --> 23:46.160
and thank him for his help.

384
23:46.240 --> 23:48.600
I'll take the new nurse to meet my mother, too.

385
23:49.680 --> 23:50.520
Of course.

386
24:38.240 --> 24:40.280
Please let this one stay for a long time.

387
25:15.560 --> 25:16.680
Where are you?

388
25:16.760 --> 25:18.200
I'm waiting in the living room.

389
25:18.800 --> 25:20.280
I just parked.

390
25:20.800 --> 25:21.760
Give me a moment.

391
25:21.840 --> 25:23.360
Ms. Song will be here soon.

392
25:23.440 --> 25:24.760
Okay. See you.

393
25:25.200 --> 25:26.240
Right.

394
25:31.560 --> 25:32.920
Just wait here for a bit, Oh.

395
25:55.440 --> 25:56.600
Damn it.

396
26:18.440 --> 26:19.800
Has the new nurse arrived?

397
26:19.880 --> 26:21.240
Um… Ms. Song,

398
26:21.800 --> 26:22.760
I think

399
26:22.840 --> 26:24.920
you should visit Mrs. Pinthong first.

400
26:25.000 --> 26:25.920
Why?

401
26:26.000 --> 26:27.560
Hasn't the nurse arrived yet?

402
26:27.640 --> 26:28.800
She has.

403
26:29.560 --> 26:32.920
Then let's meet her before taking her to see my mother.

404
26:34.880 --> 26:35.800
But…

405
26:35.880 --> 26:38.120
You haven't visited Mrs. Pinthong in a few days.

406
26:38.520 --> 26:39.960
Maybe we should see her first.

407
26:40.040 --> 26:42.080
No. Let's take care of one thing at a time.

408
26:43.400 --> 26:44.280
Uh…

409
26:46.280 --> 26:47.520
Move aside.

410
26:47.920 --> 26:48.920
All right.

411
27:01.680 --> 27:02.960
Hello, Ms. Song.

412
27:04.800 --> 27:06.200
Here's the contract.

413
27:33.880 --> 27:35.520
Section 15,

414
27:35.600 --> 27:40.040
paragraph one of the Civil and Commercial Code states that,

415
27:40.120 --> 27:41.040
"Personality begins

416
27:41.120 --> 27:43.520
with the full completion of birth as a living child,

417
27:43.600 --> 27:45.000
and ends with death."

418
27:45.680 --> 27:48.680
That means two conditions must be met.

419
27:48.760 --> 27:51.480
This will definitely be on the exam. The professor emphasized it.

420
27:51.560 --> 27:52.480
Did you memorize it?

421
27:52.560 --> 27:53.640
I think I've got it.

422
27:54.240 --> 27:55.320
I'll come back to this.

423
27:55.400 --> 27:56.280
Okay.

424
27:56.360 --> 27:57.360
Okay.

425
27:57.440 --> 28:00.320
Let's move on. I think we're done with this part.

426
28:37.520 --> 28:38.520
Hmm?

427
28:41.800 --> 28:43.080
What's wrong?

428
28:43.160 --> 28:45.040
Do you have any questions?

429
28:45.120 --> 28:46.200
No.

430
28:47.160 --> 28:48.200
Open it.

431
28:50.120 --> 28:51.400
-Open? -Mm-hmm.

432
28:56.160 --> 28:58.120
WILL YOU GO OUT WITH ME?

433
29:32.280 --> 29:33.280
Open it.

434
29:48.360 --> 29:52.280
WILL YOU GO OUT WITH ME? OK!

435
29:52.680 --> 29:54.120
Okay? Yes!

436
30:00.120 --> 30:01.240
Hey!

437
30:04.720 --> 30:05.720
Stop!

438
30:06.840 --> 30:07.960
We're dating now, okay?

439
30:08.280 --> 30:09.280
Yeah.

440
30:13.960 --> 30:15.040
Stop already!

441
30:16.120 --> 30:17.640
Let's get back to studying.

442
30:18.040 --> 30:19.320
I don't want to study anymore.

443
30:19.400 --> 30:21.320
We have to, or you'll fail.

444
30:23.240 --> 30:24.640
Fine. Let's do it.

445
31:25.000 --> 31:28.520
Keep reading. I'll be quiet, okay?

446
31:46.680 --> 31:47.960
Oops.

447
31:51.320 --> 31:52.360
Hmm…

448
31:56.480 --> 31:57.960
Give it back!

449
31:59.240 --> 32:00.960
-No. -Give it here.

450
32:01.800 --> 32:02.960
Nope.

451
32:11.400 --> 32:13.880
Don't you want to see me become a nurse?

452
32:13.960 --> 32:14.840
Hmm?

453
32:17.360 --> 32:19.040
Please?

454
32:19.120 --> 32:21.200
Pretty please?

455
32:22.120 --> 32:23.120
Please?

456
32:24.280 --> 32:25.440
-Please? -Fine.

457
32:26.600 --> 32:27.600
Thanks.

458
33:08.520 --> 33:09.600
Oh…

459
33:10.720 --> 33:12.560
If there's anything I can do,

460
33:12.960 --> 33:14.200
you have to tell me.

461
33:18.360 --> 33:19.480
Thanks.

462
33:21.840 --> 33:23.000
I think I can manage.

463
33:26.760 --> 33:27.880
Really, Song.

464
33:29.360 --> 33:31.000
I still have my mom and my sister.

465
33:32.560 --> 33:33.640
I'll be okay.

466
33:34.560 --> 33:35.920
And you have me.

467
33:39.400 --> 33:40.800
If you need any help,

468
33:41.320 --> 33:42.640
you have to tell me.

469
33:46.320 --> 33:47.440
Oh…

470
33:50.160 --> 33:51.560
promise me.

471
33:52.640 --> 33:54.120
If anything happens,

472
33:54.200 --> 33:55.520
you have to tell me.

473
33:58.240 --> 33:59.360
I will.

474
33:59.960 --> 34:01.400
I promise.

475
34:01.480 --> 34:02.680
You promised, okay?

476
34:04.200 --> 34:05.240
If you don't tell me,

477
34:05.920 --> 34:07.520
I'll be so mad.

478
34:09.639 --> 34:10.520
Mm-hmm.

479
34:12.120 --> 34:13.639
No matter what it is,

480
34:13.719 --> 34:14.840
big or small,

481
34:18.440 --> 34:20.120
we'll get through it together.

482
34:38.199 --> 34:39.199
Oh!

483
34:41.040 --> 34:42.080
Oh!

484
34:42.880 --> 34:44.120
Oh!

485
34:44.199 --> 34:45.239
Oh!

486
34:48.040 --> 34:49.040
Oh…

487
34:49.800 --> 34:51.199
Why did you pull away?

488
34:53.520 --> 34:54.960
What's wrong?

489
34:55.040 --> 34:56.880
You've been avoiding me all day.

490
34:58.960 --> 34:59.960
I'm tired of it.

491
35:00.520 --> 35:01.520
Tired?

492
35:03.840 --> 35:04.960
Of what?

493
35:06.680 --> 35:07.920
Of you, obviously.

494
35:12.680 --> 35:13.800
You're joking, right?

495
35:14.720 --> 35:16.600
You're just teasing me.

496
35:17.440 --> 35:18.640
Is this a prank?

497
35:19.200 --> 35:20.440
Was it funny?

498
35:27.560 --> 35:28.560
Look…

499
35:31.320 --> 35:32.880
If I've done something wrong,

500
35:34.080 --> 35:35.400
just tell me, okay?

501
35:36.320 --> 35:37.760
I told you. I'm tired of you.

502
35:38.120 --> 35:39.640
I'm tired of living like this.

503
35:39.720 --> 35:41.880
I want a rich girlfriend I can show off.

504
35:41.960 --> 35:43.680
I want to eat at fancy places,

505
35:43.760 --> 35:45.160
ride around in a sports car,

506
35:45.240 --> 35:46.840
and carry designer bags.

507
35:47.360 --> 35:49.160
You never give me any of that.

508
36:04.600 --> 36:05.960
Is this who you really are?

509
36:07.320 --> 36:08.440
Yes.

510
36:08.520 --> 36:09.680
This is who I am.

511
36:10.720 --> 36:12.760
I've been playing nice for so long,

512
36:12.840 --> 36:15.160
hoping you'd spend money on me.

513
36:15.240 --> 36:16.560
But in the end,

514
36:19.120 --> 36:20.440
you just can't afford it.

515
36:26.040 --> 36:28.520
So you want to eat at fancy restaurants?

516
36:28.600 --> 36:30.240
Ride around in a sports car?

517
36:30.320 --> 36:31.640
Carry designer bags?

518
36:32.640 --> 36:33.760
Yeah.

519
36:34.480 --> 36:35.760
Do you want necklaces,

520
36:35.840 --> 36:37.480
rings, and watches too?

521
36:37.560 --> 36:38.480
I do!

522
36:39.160 --> 36:40.480
Can you afford any of that?

523
36:41.320 --> 36:42.360
Probably not.

524
36:42.800 --> 36:44.320
Even for my birthday,

525
36:44.400 --> 36:47.120
all you could give me was a pathetic handmade card.

526
36:47.200 --> 36:49.240
Do you know how embarrassed I felt in front of my friends?

527
36:49.320 --> 36:51.320
Have you ever even asked what I want?

528
36:52.160 --> 36:53.280
You're embarrassed?

529
36:56.440 --> 36:59.040
I spent the whole day making that card.

530
37:00.760 --> 37:02.360
That piece of paper

531
37:03.200 --> 37:05.080
might as well be trash.

532
37:07.160 --> 37:08.240
Trash?

533
37:12.240 --> 37:14.800
So you're just like everyone else,

534
37:15.160 --> 37:16.280
chasing money.

535
37:16.680 --> 37:17.720
Yes.

536
37:18.320 --> 37:19.640
This is who I am.

537
37:20.280 --> 37:21.240
Always have been.

538
37:22.960 --> 37:25.240
We shouldn't waste each other's time.

539
37:28.760 --> 37:29.960
Let's break up.

540
37:30.600 --> 37:31.640
Oh!

541
37:38.000 --> 37:40.320
Don't go. Please.

542
37:41.320 --> 37:42.280
Let go of me.

543
37:42.360 --> 37:43.720
Don't go.

544
37:43.800 --> 37:45.040
-Let go! -Oh!

545
37:45.120 --> 37:46.640
You're so annoying!

546
37:51.240 --> 37:52.440
From now on,

547
37:53.840 --> 37:55.960
don't ever come into my life again!

548
37:58.000 --> 38:01.880
♪ I notice every glance ♪

549
38:01.960 --> 38:02.920
Oh!

550
38:03.000 --> 38:06.920
♪ The way you look at me ♪

551
38:07.440 --> 38:12.360
♪ And what they're hiding inside ♪

552
38:12.640 --> 38:16.160
♪ I think we might be the same ♪

553
38:17.200 --> 38:20.320
♪ Hiding our true feelings ♪

554
38:20.400 --> 38:23.240
♪ Not wanting them to come out ♪

555
38:23.600 --> 38:26.800
♪ But the closer we get ♪

556
38:26.880 --> 38:30.760
♪ The more my heart wavers ♪

557
38:31.240 --> 38:35.280
♪ I want to surrender to every voice in my heart ♪

558
38:35.360 --> 38:37.640
♪ But my mouth denies my heart ♪

559
38:37.720 --> 38:41.400
♪ Never speaking the truth ♪

560
38:41.480 --> 38:46.560
♪ Even though everything I do ♪

561
38:46.640 --> 38:49.840
♪ Is telling you I love you ♪

562
38:49.920 --> 38:54.360
♪ I give in every time our eyes meet ♪

563
38:54.440 --> 38:56.040
Why?

564
38:56.120 --> 38:58.760
-♪ But I'm unable to show it ♪ -Why?

565
39:00.840 --> 39:02.360
I'm sorry.

566
39:02.440 --> 39:08.840
♪ I want to say "I love you" for once, Just like how I feel ♪

567
39:30.360 --> 39:31.360
Sarttra.

568
39:40.080 --> 39:42.360
Something must have come up with Ms. Song.

569
39:43.080 --> 39:44.280
Please have a seat, Oh.

570
39:58.400 --> 39:59.960
You know that woman?

571
40:00.360 --> 40:01.240
Uh…

572
40:01.320 --> 40:02.360
I think…

573
40:02.440 --> 40:03.600
I think I do.

574
40:04.040 --> 40:06.480
Then why did you bring her into this house?

575
40:07.600 --> 40:10.600
Ms. Song, I'm truly sorry. I didn't check beforehand.

576
40:10.680 --> 40:12.400
Smith recommended her,

577
40:12.480 --> 40:14.200
saying she was his girlfriend,

578
40:16.680 --> 40:18.200
so I didn't look into it properly.

579
40:18.840 --> 40:21.000
Should I go cancel the contract?

580
40:23.840 --> 40:24.920
Give it to me.

581
40:36.400 --> 40:40.680
TERMINATION OF THE CONTRACT AND PENALTIES A PENALTY EQUIVALENT TO FIVE TIMES THE SALARY

582
40:44.200 --> 40:45.880
Contract termination…

583
40:53.160 --> 40:55.880
SIGNATURE MISS UTTAWADEE SENTANUN

584
41:21.520 --> 41:22.680
It's been a long time.

585
41:23.440 --> 41:25.280
So this is what you've been after.

586
41:31.680 --> 41:33.200
I'd like to turn down this job.

587
41:34.040 --> 41:36.320
This contract isn't complete anyway.

588
41:36.840 --> 41:38.040
Wait, Oh.

589
41:38.120 --> 41:39.200
What's going on?

590
41:44.960 --> 41:46.240
Not complete?

591
41:47.200 --> 41:48.640
Which part isn't?

592
42:04.280 --> 42:07.040
SIGNATURE EMPLOYER

593
42:12.400 --> 42:13.360
There.

594
42:13.440 --> 42:14.760
Now it's complete.

595
42:15.920 --> 42:17.320
-But-- -Right.

596
42:17.800 --> 42:20.720
I heard you say you wanted to turn down the job.

597
42:21.160 --> 42:24.600
What does the contract say about resigning

598
42:25.600 --> 42:28.760
without giving 120 days' notice?

599
42:34.640 --> 42:35.520
That's right.

600
42:37.120 --> 42:40.680
You have to pay a penalty of five times your salary.

601
42:45.560 --> 42:47.080
Can you afford that?

602
42:50.880 --> 42:53.320
Can someone like you afford it?

603
42:55.640 --> 42:56.680
Uh…

604
43:04.320 --> 43:05.520
Fine.

605
43:06.000 --> 43:07.000
I'll do it.

606
43:08.080 --> 43:09.880
Good. So much for making a fuss.

607
43:10.360 --> 43:12.800
But I'm submitting my resignation notice today.

608
43:13.400 --> 43:15.600
I'll work the full 120 days.

609
43:20.080 --> 43:21.440
Fine by me.

610
43:28.400 --> 43:29.760
Impressive.

611
43:30.480 --> 43:31.560
Very impressive.

612
43:43.680 --> 43:44.880
From now on,

613
43:45.520 --> 43:46.920
prepare to fall apart,

614
43:47.560 --> 43:48.760
Uttawadee.

615
43:48.840 --> 43:51.520
♪ But my mouth denies my heart ♪

616
43:51.600 --> 43:54.960
♪ Never speaking the truth ♪

617
43:55.040 --> 44:00.080
♪ Even though everything I do ♪

618
44:00.160 --> 44:03.480
♪ Is telling you I love you ♪

619
44:03.560 --> 44:07.800
♪ I give in every time our eyes meet ♪

620
44:07.880 --> 44:14.880
♪ But I'm unable to show it ♪

621
44:16.080 --> 44:22.640
♪ I want to say "I love you" for once, Just like how I feel ♪

622
44:25.600 --> 44:28.400
Did you really think I'd trust you to take care of my mother?

623
44:28.480 --> 44:30.040
If you don't trust me,

624
44:30.120 --> 44:31.360
why are you keeping me here?

625
44:31.920 --> 44:33.080
Don't put it that way.

626
44:33.160 --> 44:35.640
Someone like you isn't worth keeping around.

627
44:37.000 --> 44:38.960
Your smile disappears the moment you see me.

628
44:39.040 --> 44:41.440
You must have wanted to be a doctor's wife so badly.

629
44:50.560 --> 44:53.000
♪ But my mouth denies my heart ♪

630
44:53.080 --> 44:56.680
♪ Never speaking the truth ♪

631
44:56.760 --> 45:01.880
♪ Even though everything I do ♪

632
45:01.960 --> 45:05.080
♪ Is telling you I love you ♪

633
45:05.160 --> 45:09.600
♪ I give in every time our eyes meet ♪

634
45:09.680 --> 45:16.680
♪ But I'm unable to show it ♪

635
45:17.800 --> 45:24.160
♪ I want to say "I love you" for once, Just like how I feel ♪
